# S15-classic: e1m1's start, a still camera, Classic at 320x200 shown 4:3 ("This is
# quake-srp", S15). S15-slop is the same view in the slop preset at 1920x1080.
#
# Assembly (S15): S15-classic alone (its 4:3 box) to file second 2.5; then over 2.5 to 5.0
# (smoothstep) the box widens from 1440 to 1920 pixels about the centre while the picture
# inside it cross-fades to S15-slop.

map e1m1

duration 10.5
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 320x200
hud off
cvar gamma 0.7

camera fixed 480,-352,110 0,90

events on
